    "name": "Hotel Reservation API",
    "description": "Comprehensive Postman collection for the Hotel Reservation and Booking Management RESTful API.\n\n### Features:\n- User & Admin Authentication (JWT with bcrypt hashing)\n- User Profile & Role Management\n- Hotel CRUD Management & Zod Validation\n- Room Inventory Management\n- Reservation & Booking Processing\n- Payment Simulation (Card, Bank Transfer, Cash)\n- Real-time Availability & Date-range Filtering\n\n### Environment Variables Used:\n- `baseUrl`: Default `http://localhost:5000`\n- `authToken`: JWT token for authenticated customer requests (automatically populated upon Login/Register)\n- `adminToken`: JWT token for admin-only operations\n- `hotelId`, `roomId`, `reservationId`, `paymentId`, `userId`: Dynamic resource IDs",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
